<hr data-start="85" data-end="88">
<h1 data-start="90" data-end="107">ğŸ¯ Short Answer</h1>
<p data-start="108" data-end="253">ğŸ‘‰ <strong data-start="111" data-end="253">Agar tum client-server + communication + shared state hata doge, tab system â€œundistributedâ€ (i.e., single system / standalone) ban jayega.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="255" data-end="258">
<h1 data-start="260" data-end="302">ğŸ§  Tumhare prompt ke parts aur unka role</h1>
<p data-start="304" data-end="338">Main simple breakdown deta hoon ğŸ‘‡</p>
<hr data-start="340" data-end="343">
<h2 data-start="345" data-end="396">1ï¸âƒ£ Multiple Clients + Server (MOST IMPORTANT â—)</h2>
<p data-start="398" data-end="445">ğŸ‘‰ â€œMultiple clients connect to central serverâ€</p>
<p data-start="447" data-end="484"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Socket.IO</span></span></p>
<h3 data-start="486" data-end="517">ğŸ”¥ Agar ye remove kar diya:</h3>
