</li>
<li data-start="801" data-end="840">
<p data-start="803" data-end="840">No interaction<br data-start="817" data-end="820">
ğŸ‘‰ âŒ Not distributed</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="842" data-end="845">
<h2 data-start="847" data-end="885">3ï¸âƒ£ Shared Game State (Server Side)</h2>
