<h1 data-start="1642" data-end="1664">ğŸ§  Viva-ready answer</h1>
<p data-start="1666" data-end="1680">Agar sir bole:</p>
<p data-start="1682" data-end="1749"><strong data-start="1682" data-end="1749">â€œKaunsa part remove karne se system non-distributed ho jayega?â€</strong></p>
